# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore
#
# LaTeX build output -- the manual/ compile drops all of these beside its
# source. Listed here (not left to a user's global gitignore) so a fresh clone
# building the manual stays clean for anyone.
*.pdf
*.log
*.aux
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.toc
*.out

# tcolorbox's `listings' scratch file (\jobname.listing, via manual-style.sty)
*.listing

*.swp
